DEATH_CD: .WORD 0
LAUNCH_CD: .WORD 0
WEAPON_CD: .BLKW NWEAP
COOL_END:
NCOOL = <COOL_END-COOLDOWNS>/2
WEAPON_SPAN: .BLKW NWEAP ; actual duration at attack time, including buffs
BAR_USED: .BLKB 24.
WORLD_MAP: .BLKB 3721.
